			<div class="content" id="post-content-1559637">
									

<blockquote>
<p>SCP-1650-1-D seemingly erases any trace of blood it comes into contact with. Because of this, ingestion or injection of SCP-1650-1-D is instantly fatal.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>For it to work like that, even the tiniest amount would have to instantly erase the entire volume of blood with which it comes into contact (for instance, as soon as a speck of it touches a gallon pot of blood the entire gallon instantly vanished). Otherwise, ingesting it would result in the subject gradually losing blood as the oil was gradually absorbed through the intestines (and after a delay for digestion), leading to eventual death, and injection would destroy blood as it flowed into the injection site, leading to a quick but not instant death.</p>

