<p>It is implied the explosive was in his stomach, not strapped on his body. The Foundation's normal scans would have picked that as well, but this explosive managed to somehow slip by.</p>
<p>As for the other point, that's a failure on my part. The log is supposed to imply the priest is a plaything in the hands of his superiors, who never intended to make any sort of deal and wanted the priest to die in case he was captured, hence they convinced him the Foundation would attempt to deceive him. It wasn't made clear, and that's my fault.</p>

